        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find <span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^2]</span> given that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Find [MATH: B^2] given that [MATH: [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Computing <span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^2,]</span> we have</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^{2}|= B \u22c5 B; = [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3] \u22c5 [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]; = [0|0; 0|0]; = O.]</span></p><p>Notice that, since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^2=O,]</span> the matrix <span class=\"math\">[MATH: B]</span> is a nilpotent matrix of index <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Computing [MATH: B^2,] we have\n\n[MATH: B^{2}|= B \u22c5 B; = [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3] \u22c5 [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]; = [0|0; 0|0]; = O.]\n\nNotice that, since [MATH: B^2=O,] the matrix [MATH: B] is a nilpotent matrix of index [MATH: 2.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind [MATH: B^2] given that [MATH: [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nComputing [MATH: B^2,] we have\n\n[MATH: B^{2}|= B \u22c5 B; = [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3] \u22c5 [3|9; \u2212 1|\u2212 3]; = [0|0; 0|0]; = O.]\n\nNotice that, since [MATH: B^2=O,] the matrix [MATH: B] is a nilpotent matrix of index [MATH: 2.]"
      },
