          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>is idempotent because <span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^2 = B]</span>:</p>",
            "readable_text": "is idempotent because [MATH: B^2 = B]:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: B^{2}|= [3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2][3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2]; = [3 \u22c5 3 + (\u2212 6) \u22c5 1|3 \u22c5 (\u2212 6) + (\u2212 6) \u22c5 (\u2212 2); 1 \u22c5 3 + (\u2212 2) \u22c5 1|1 \u22c5 (\u2212 6) + (\u2212 2) \u22c5 (\u2212 2)]; = [3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2]; = B]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: B^{2}|= [3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2][3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2]; = [3 \u22c5 3 + (\u2212 6) \u22c5 1|3 \u22c5 (\u2212 6) + (\u2212 6) \u22c5 (\u2212 2); 1 \u22c5 3 + (\u2212 2) \u22c5 1|1 \u22c5 (\u2212 6) + (\u2212 2) \u22c5 (\u2212 2)]; = [3|\u2212 6; 1|\u2212 2]; = B]",
