        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nIf [MATH: B = [\u2212 2|1; \u2212 6|3]], then [MATH: B^{5} =]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: [\u2212 2|1; \u2212 6|3]]\nb. [MATH: [\u2212 322|\u2212 131; 786|\u2212 453]]\nc. [MATH: [0|0; 0|0]]\nd. [MATH: [2|1; \u2212 6|\u2212 3]]\ne. [MATH: [\u2212 62|181; 1086|843]]"
